Description: Web UI for the Midwire USB proxy appliance
 Lists the USB devices attached to the Pi, starts and stops usb-proxy with
 the options picked in the page, shows its log live and serves the traffic
 captures it writes. Settings such as starting the proxy automatically when
 a device is plugged in are kept across reboots.
 .
 With NetworkManager installed it also manages Wi-Fi: renaming the hotspot,
 changing its password, or joining an existing network instead.
 .
 A new install logs in with admin / admin. Change it after the first login.
